iture is included in the sale. It is also within walking distance of Aloha Strip and a wide range of restaurants shops and everyday amenities.\n\nThe open plan design creates a bright and welcoming living space. The private rooftop solarium offers 360 degree views with an outdoor kitchen and shower. There is also a BBQ area with a dining space and sun loungers for relaxing or entertaining throughout the year.\n\nLos Dragos is a well maintained community with ‌a ‌gym ‌plus ‌tennis ‌and ‌padel courts. ‌This is ‌an excellent choice for buyers ‌looking ‌for ‌a ‌luxury ‌home in Nueva Andalucia ‌close ‌to ‌golf ‌beaches ‌and ‌Puerto ‌Banus."},"features":{"es":["Primera línea de Golf","Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Puerto","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Suroeste","Excelente","Reformado Recientemente","Comunitaria","Aire Acondicionado","Calefacción Central.","Chimenea","Mar","Montaña","Golf","Panorámicas","Jardín","Piscina","Terraza Cubierta","Armarios Empotrados","Terraza Privada","Solario","Gimnasio","Paddle Tenis","Barbacoa","Amueblada","Cocina Comedor","Comunitario","Recinto Cerrado","Comunitario","Golf","Lujo"],"en":["Frontline Golf","Close To Golf","Close To Port","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Town","Close To Schools","South West","Excellent","Recently Renovated","Communal","Air Conditioning","Central Heating","Fireplace","Sea","Mountain","Golf","Panoramic","Garden","Pool","Covered Terrace","Fitted Wardrobes","Private Terrace","Solarium","Gym","Paddle Tennis","Barbeque","Fully Furnished","Kitchen-Lounge","Communal","Gated Complex","Communal","Golf","Luxury"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available"}